WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.830
Level 4, Lucid Nightmare.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.130
You realize you're dreaming.

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.170
You become conscious inside the nightmare.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.630
In a normal lucid dream,
this would be liberating.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.810
You'd take control, fly
away, reshape reality.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.110
But in a Lucid Nightmare,
awareness doesn't give you power.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.430
Instead, it traps you.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.790
The monster is still chasing you.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.890
The walls are still closing in.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:30.000
You're screaming at yourself to wake
